{"title": "A Mother's Loathing", "pageid": 6905, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/A_Mother's_Loathing", "categories": ["Potions", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f2/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"A Mother's Loathing image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/ELX_Superior_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>A Mother's Loathing</b> is one of <a href=\"/wiki/Ethel%27s_special_potions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ethel's special potions\">Ethel's special potions</a> that can be consumed for a positive effect.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></pictur